The trajectory, which uses envs, is defined in the global environment, but now your envs is inside a lapply, so the trajectory cannot find it. That is, the same problem as we discussed here <https://groups.google.com/d/msg/simmer-devel/ftRPFZJ51TY/1olNh-yQCgAJ>, so you have two options:
Place the trajectory inside too.
Define envs with a double-arrow assignment: envs <<- simmer()
​

