>>>>>>>> days) and 32 beds gave the following
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> server status: 30(32) | queue status: 0
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> > mean(x$queue)
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> [1] 0.57
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> Does this mean that: "if I increase the center capacity from 30 to
>>>>>>>> 32 beds, I will have no waiting list?"
