Thanks Shawn. That does the trick.

However, this is easier with the current version (check out the master branch on GitHub), because the generation function can return more than one value at once (see #65 <https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/65>), so now we can do the following:
add_generator("newpatient", newpatient, function() c(rexp(1, 1/myIAT), rep(0, 9)))
​

